lines.text:
I-it's delicious,
{G}
(That's a man's kindness.)

Look, {G}
don't cry.
Everyone's looking.

Y-{G}
No need to rush,
the boats won't run off.

W-well, {G}
you're Yoshio's sister,
so that's how I see you.

Gosh, {G}
says things that
make my heart pound.

Um, {G}
the people in front
can see your panties.

Y-{G}
It's okay, really.
So don't cry, okay?
